{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI reached Kassel at eleven, sharp as a pin. The air is cool after the heat of the Rhineland, and my legs are thanking me for the walk through the old town. The architecture is heavy, but the gardens are superb. I spent the afternoon wandering the Herkules, though I confess the statues are a bit overwrought; I paid two thalers for the guide, which was a waste, as I know the history of the place better than he does.\n\nDinner was unremarkable—thin broth, cold meat. I paid four thalers for the room, which is dear for the quality. I am tired, but my mind is clear. I miss the smell of our library in Berlin and the sound of the boys’ laughter. Write to me soon, and tell me how the servants managed in my absence. I shall travel to Frankfurt tomorrow, if the weather holds.\n\nYour affectionate,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795219304,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":200,"prompt_tokens":1090,"total_tokens":1290,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-CBbx7gG4UZDKm13BL3Fp1nwKaa8lVAdj","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1090,"prompt_ms":1035.328,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9498422018348623,"prompt_per_second":1052.8064536069728,"predicted_n":200,"predicted_ms":4690.363,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.569663316582915,"predicted_per_second":42.427419796719356}}